---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
---

<PageLayout
    title="Privacy - Vincent Foriel"
    description="Privacy policy of Vincent Foriel's website: cookie-free visit statistics (Umami), no forms."
    currentPath={Astro.url.pathname}
>
    <Section>
        <article class="legal">
            <h1>Privacy</h1>

            <h2>Visit statistics</h2>
            <p>
                To know which pages are read, this website uses <a href="https://umami.is">Umami</a> (Umami Cloud
                service). It sets no cookies and serves no advertising. For each page view it records the page, the
                website you came from, the type of browser, operating system and device, the language and the country.
                Your IP address is sent to it to work out the country but, according to Umami, it is not stored. The
                details are in <a href="https://umami.is/privacy">Umami's privacy policy</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you would rather not be counted, a content blocker or the "Do Not Track" setting of your browser is
                enough: the website works the same way.
            </p>

            <h2>Storage in your browser</h2>
            <p>
                The light or dark theme, the dismissal of the information banner and the "reduced animations" mode are
                kept in your own browser (local or session storage). None of it is sent to me.
            </p>

            <h2>Hosting</h2>
            <p>
                Like any host, GitHub (which serves this website) receives the IP address of visitors to deliver the pages
                and protect its service, according to its
                <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">privacy statement</a>.
            </p>

            <h2>If you write to me</h2>
            <p>
                The website has no forms. Messages sent to
                <a href="mailto:vincent.foriel@gmail.com">vincent.foriel@gmail.com</a> are only used to answer you.
            </p>

            <h2>Your rights</h2>
            <p>
                For any question about your data, write to me at the address above. You may also lodge a complaint with
                the French data protection authority (<a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en">CNIL</a>).
            </p>
        </article>
    </Section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
    .legal {
        max-width: 72ch;
    }

    .legal h2 {
        font-size: var(--text-xl);
        margin-block: var(--space-10) var(--space-3);
    }

    .legal p + p {
        margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
    }
</style>
